{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-09_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-09","title":"騎士","storyCode":"0-9","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"5eba46818942b03ea0912432fd2d6f0037c76898a813aad1ebe3d877ebfdabe9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"きゃっ――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"！　危ない！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"だ……大丈夫です、このくらい……かすり傷ですから……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"包囲網が、少しずつ狭まってきています……早くここから抜け出さないと……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"そうは言っても、今の人数では守りに入るしかない……！　包囲自体の突破口は見つけたが、増援がなければどうにもならんぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかりました。であれば、もう少しだけ耐えてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"敵方の先鋒には、我々――術師オペレーターが対応します！　みなさんは、狙撃手を優先的に攻撃してください！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"アハハ！　いいねえ、その調子だ！　――F3からE5へ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、あのガキ……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"素晴らしい！　そのまま行くよ！　――次はB4からB5だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"！　敵が後方から回り込んできます！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"であれば、牽制を！　重装オペレーターを二人、狙撃オペレーターを一人、対応に回してください！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"それじゃ、今度は――H2からH6！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘……！？　あ、あの人たち、突撃してきますっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、前衛オペレーター！　奴らを抑えろ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"わお、いい表情するじゃないか。もっと苦しんで見せてよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"――さあ、今だ！　C7へ！　奴らのルークを蹴散らせ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"術師！？　一体どこから！？　――まさか、重装兵の背後に隠れて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ来るぞ、伏せろ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"きゃああっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐ、ッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"――死ね、死ね！　雨に打たれる炎みたいに、惨めに消えろ！　アハハハハ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……あんな指示で――チェスの駒でも動かすような一言で……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"粗暴な構成員たちをたった一人で制御して、あれほど正確な指揮を執るだなんて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"このままでは、向こうに有利な展開へと持ち込まれて――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"少し見方を変えてみろ。あのガキが部隊の要なら、奴さえ抑えればどうとでもなるということだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"――総員、奴らに付け入る隙を与えるな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……クソッ……しかし何にせよ、時間がないぞ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ！　これ以上、足止めを喰らうわけにはいきません……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何か……何か方法を見つけて、この状況を打開しなければ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターや、みなさんの身に危険が……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"う、うわああああっ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"――えっ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"……一体……何が起きてるんだ？　――僕の兵士が、吹き飛ばされた……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは……何だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――到着が遅いと思えば、こういうことか。お陰で、待ち時間のあいだに、市民の避難誘導まで済ませてしまったが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　その声は……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――さて、道を開けてもらおうか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"皆、今だ！　敵が陣形を整える前に、一気に仕掛けるぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ニアールさんっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、無事で良かった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ひとまず、話はあとだ。まずは撤退しよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ！　助かったぞ、ニアール。お前がいてくれてよかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"いいや、そちらが信号弾で正確な座標を教えてくれたおかげだ。……しかし、これは確かに厄介な状況だな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ときに――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたがDr.{@nickname}か？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――カジミエーシュの耀騎士（ようきし）、ニアール。あなたたちを迎えに参上した。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["？？？","ニアール"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["メフィスト"]}]}
